{"id":"n18832-1-7","stage":4,"title":"과반수 · 过半数","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18832-1-7-1","ko":"모임에 몇 명이 참석했습니까?","zh":"有多少人参加了聚会？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"모임에","meaning":"聚会","explanation":"모임：聚会；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"모임","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61519","senseId":"1","lemma":"모임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모임에","audio":"/audio/9b4c76c72e07467e4dae.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"명이","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명이","audio":"/audio/2cef3c70027edf3bbe10.mp3"}},{"text":"참석했습니까?","meaning":"参加，出席","explanation":"참석하다：参加，出席；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"참석하다","audio":"/audio/f054f7e6fad02b9e2341.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62321","senseId":"1","lemma":"참석하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참석했습니까","audio":"/audio/0d7f0040d78e99c874fd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2485fc53da01e9d6","term":"모임","zh":"聚会","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3","entryId":"61519","definition":"多人为做某事而聚在一起的行为。","pronunciation":["모임"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]},{"id":"f054f7e6fad02b9e","term":"